{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23975","headline":"晚起 · 白居易","name":"晚起","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"烂熳朝眠後，频伸晚起时。\n煖炉生火早，寒镜裹头迟。\n融雪煎香茗，调酥煮乳糜。\n慵馋还自哂，快活亦谁知。\n酒性温无毒，琴声淡不悲。\n荣公三乐外，仍弄小男儿。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23975.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23975","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}